<node id="Étudiant(e)">
  <data key="d0">Étudiant(e)</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Étudiant(e) refers to a student, an individual engaged in learning, mentioned consistently throughout the verbatims in both male and female forms.&lt;SEP&gt;A person studying in an educational institution, participating in higher education activities, particularly in Corsica.&lt;SEP&gt;A profession representing individuals who are engaged in academic studies, often in schools or universities.&lt;SEP&gt;A person engaged in studies at an educational institution, mentioned multiple times in various quality of life contexts.&lt;SEP&gt;A student focused on various dimensions of quality of life.&lt;SEP&gt;Students in Corsica participating in the survey that express satisfaction regarding their quality of life and happiness.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-bc2a4c9fbcd8f37dfe48f336cbbe23d7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bc2a4c9fbcd8f37dfe48f336cbbe23d7-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c6e43bd634411734a6b905f38e6c188f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2cde183c2f8365b319d177367a294261-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2cde183c2f8365b319d177367a294261-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-be2a5df1e51e18d87ddafb6b28a369d8-chunk-000</data>
