<node id="Santé">
  <data key="d0">Santé</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Santé, which translates to "health" in English, represents a multifaceted concept essential for quality of life and overall well-being. It encompasses physical, mental, and social well-being and is defined as a state of being free from illness or injury. The holistic view of Santé underscores its significance in individual lives and its overarching impact on societal well-being.

Recent evaluations of health services associated with Santé reveal considerable public dissatisfaction. Various ratings reflect concerns regarding accessibility and quality within the healthcare system. For instance, health services have been rated at 2.46 out of 5, pointing to significant issues such as long waiting times for appointments and inadequate access to healthcare professionals. Overall health assessments have yielded a similar score of 2.63 out of 5, indicating a persistent concern among the populace about the state of health services.

A specific dimension assessing health conditions within the framework of Santé has garnered a low rating of 2.52 out of 5, signifying a poor perception of health conditions in general. Furthermore, individuals' satisfaction with health services appears to vary across different demographics; for example, retirees report access issues, while students express similar dissatisfaction, reflected in a slightly higher score of 2.63 out of 5 regarding their health service experiences.

Overall, these ratings, particularly a notably low score of 2.40 out of 5 for various dimensions of health, highlight the urgent need to address the challenges within the healthcare system. Improving the quality and accessibility of health services is critical to fostering better outcomes in Santé, thus enhancing individuals' quality of life and well-being in society at large.&lt;SEP&gt;Santé refers to health, considered a fundamental pillar for quality of life, with significant emphasis on accessibility and quality of care.&lt;SEP&gt;Santé is a concept mentioned as an absolute priority for quality of life, often associated with access to healthcare and a healthy lifestyle.&lt;SEP&gt;Santé refers to health, a prominent theme in the survey responses.&lt;SEP&gt;Considered a fundamental wealth, representing the idea that health is crucial for overall well-being.&lt;SEP&gt;The state of being free from illness or injury, linked to environmental quality in the responses gathered in the survey.&lt;SEP&gt;The state of health, which some respondents prioritize over financial wealth, emphasizing its importance for overall well-being.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-bc2a4c9fbcd8f37dfe48f336cbbe23d7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c6e43bd634411734a6b905f38e6c188f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2cde183c2f8365b319d177367a294261-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2cde183c2f8365b319d177367a294261-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2cde183c2f8365b319d177367a294261-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8aad22cd547f46981c0c7e2b64860b22-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8aad22cd547f46981c0c7e2b64860b22-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5fedbc4a6b16f609bda38e59c975501c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-74905ab4a9718f1c4ec97ba6f336e723-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b6654ba40869e4446884d807777b08c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b6654ba40869e4446884d807777b08c-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-602c83a7ec390ae9e25b67b17988dedc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4fc690b476bf00502fa678c4931b4fb2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4fc690b476bf00502fa678c4931b4fb2-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-be2a5df1e51e18d87ddafb6b28a369d8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-37b4833e5a4ced914cfa6572c9de7980-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d8b4d39bd79510a410aa6623160f3ac3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d8b4d39bd79510a410aa6623160f3ac3-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-705b4ab560e98a9130a4a5665f8b6ede-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ef4fc8b2bef9fc9c6fdc4e727c31f588-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f456bef81ff3c55668e3111d92c18339-chunk-000</data>
