<node id="Ratio Vie Pro/Vie Perso">
  <data key="d0">Ratio Vie Pro/Vie Perso</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Ratio Vie Pro/Vie Perso refers to the balance between work life and personal life, highlighted in various statements as essential for a healthy lifestyle.&lt;SEP&gt;An abstract idea concerning the balance between professional life and personal life, alongside social relationships.&lt;SEP&gt;An abstract idea that reflects the balance between professional life and personal life, emphasizing harmony between the two.&lt;SEP&gt;Ratio Vie Pro/Vie Perso denotes the work-life balance, receiving a score of 3.36 out of 5, suggesting an acceptable balance.&lt;SEP&gt;Ratio Vie Pro/Vie Perso pertains to the work-life balance, rated at 3.71 out of 5, indicating a positive perception of balancing professional and personal life.&lt;SEP&gt;A dimension measuring the balance between professional and personal life satisfaction among students, scored at 3.05/5.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-bc2a4c9fbcd8f37dfe48f336cbbe23d7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c6e43bd634411734a6b905f38e6c188f-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2cde183c2f8365b319d177367a294261-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5fedbc4a6b16f609bda38e59c975501c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b6654ba40869e4446884d807777b08c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-be2a5df1e51e18d87ddafb6b28a369d8-chunk-000</data>
