<node id="Logement">
  <data key="d0">Logement</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Logement refers to housing or accommodation, which plays a crucial role in ensuring comfort and well-being. It is an essential aspect of quality of life, emphasizing the importance of stable and affordable housing for personal and professional integration. The concept encapsulates the idea that housing significantly affects individual and communal satisfaction.

In various evaluations of housing conditions, Logement has received a range of satisfaction scores. The overall perception of housing conditions is generally positive, with ratings that include a score of 3.84 out of 5, particularly noted in Ajaccio, a score of 4.05, and a rating of 3.67 out of 5. Additionally, Logement has been highlighted with a score of 4.00 out of 5, suggesting contentment among residents with their housing situations. Another evaluation presents a score of 3.98 out of 5, indicating a favorable perception of living conditions.

The most noteworthy finding is that Logement received the highest rating of 4.08 out of 5, with a majority of respondents expressing very high satisfaction regarding their housing. This indicates a strong sense of satisfaction among individuals regarding their living conditions.

Logement not only encompasses general housing satisfaction but also specifically addresses different demographics, including retirees and students, with metrics indicating satisfaction levels in these groups. This overall understanding reinforces the notion that housing is not merely a fundamental need but also a vital determinant of quality of life, influencing both individual well-being and social integration.&lt;SEP&gt;Logement refers to housing, emphasizing the need for accessible, suitable, and quality accommodation, particularly for students and young professionals.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-bc2a4c9fbcd8f37dfe48f336cbbe23d7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c6e43bd634411734a6b905f38e6c188f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2cde183c2f8365b319d177367a294261-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2cde183c2f8365b319d177367a294261-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2cde183c2f8365b319d177367a294261-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8aad22cd547f46981c0c7e2b64860b22-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8aad22cd547f46981c0c7e2b64860b22-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5fedbc4a6b16f609bda38e59c975501c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-74905ab4a9718f1c4ec97ba6f336e723-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b6654ba40869e4446884d807777b08c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-602c83a7ec390ae9e25b67b17988dedc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-602c83a7ec390ae9e25b67b17988dedc-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4fc690b476bf00502fa678c4931b4fb2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4fc690b476bf00502fa678c4931b4fb2-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-be2a5df1e51e18d87ddafb6b28a369d8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-be2a5df1e51e18d87ddafb6b28a369d8-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d8b4d39bd79510a410aa6623160f3ac3-chunk-000</data>
