<node id="Sécurité">
  <data key="d0">Sécurité</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Sécurité, translating to "security" in English, is a vital aspect of quality of life, particularly concerning personal safety in public spaces. It encompasses the condition of being free from danger or threat, highlighting its importance as a fundamental element of an individual's overall well-being.

The perceived level of Sécurité among residents has been assessed through various scoring systems. In several evaluations, scores have varied but generally indicate a sense of security among the population. For example, a score of 3.81 out of 5 reflects a generally positive feeling of safety, while another assessment recorded a score of 3.68 out of 5, still conveying a reasonable sense of contentment regarding safety. Other ratings include 3.79 out of 5 and 3.77 out of 5, suggesting favorable views on security in the environment. One assessment showed a higher rating of 3.88 out of 5, indicating strong feelings of safety expressed by respondents, including retirees and students. Additionally, there's mention of a lower score of 3.00 out of 5, indicating that not all residents share the same confidence in their safety, revealing a variance in perceptions within the community.

Overall, Sécurité encapsulates the collective attitudes towards safety and personal well-being, reflecting both a general sense of security and notable differences in concern among different segments of the population. The existence of varying degrees of satisfaction emphasizes the complexity of safety perceptions and how they can fluctuate among different groups, such as retirees and students.&lt;SEP&gt;Safety is noted as a theme that is rarely discussed among survey participants, indicating potential disinterest or lack of visibility.&lt;SEP&gt;Sécurité denotes the need for tranquility and safety, especially for women and families, as an essential aspect of life in Corsica.&lt;SEP&gt;Sécurité represents the theme of safety and security in Grosseto-Prugna, encompassing residents' feelings and interpretations related to their personal safety and social environment.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-bc2a4c9fbcd8f37dfe48f336cbbe23d7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2cde183c2f8365b319d177367a294261-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9d0d1641d86faa1a8df6dd5a1e615c1d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8aad22cd547f46981c0c7e2b64860b22-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8aad22cd547f46981c0c7e2b64860b22-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5fedbc4a6b16f609bda38e59c975501c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-74905ab4a9718f1c4ec97ba6f336e723-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b6654ba40869e4446884d807777b08c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b6654ba40869e4446884d807777b08c-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-602c83a7ec390ae9e25b67b17988dedc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-602c83a7ec390ae9e25b67b17988dedc-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4fc690b476bf00502fa678c4931b4fb2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4fc690b476bf00502fa678c4931b4fb2-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-be2a5df1e51e18d87ddafb6b28a369d8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-be2a5df1e51e18d87ddafb6b28a369d8-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2172b80c51b8f07f0605ed31d163c678-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-37b4833e5a4ced914cfa6572c9de7980-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d8b4d39bd79510a410aa6623160f3ac3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fc76b7f4d4c75d4ea66d01fc9075ce68-chunk-000</data>
