<node id="Culture">
  <data key="d0">Culture</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The entity "Culture" encompasses a broad range of definitions and assessments related to shared social behaviors and values. It is characterized as the set of shared attitudes, values, goals, and practices that define an institution, organization, or group, as well as the social behaviors and norms present in human societies, which include arts, beliefs, and customs.

Culture is also described as a dimension of quality of life, highlighting elements such as language, religion, and music. This dimension is quantitatively assessed in various contexts, such as in Ajaccio, where culture scored 3.49 out of 5, reflecting residents' appreciation of cultural aspects. However, assessments of cultural engagement indicate a score of 3.18 out of 5, suggesting that there is potential for improvement in this area.

Further evaluations reveal that cultural offerings received a moderate to low satisfaction rating of 2.94 out of 5, while cultural satisfaction was rated at 3.43 out of 5, indicating an average perception of available cultural amenities. Additionally, a separate dimension that assesses cultural satisfaction scored 3.08 out of 5.

Overall, the concept of culture reflects both subjective interpretations and quantitative evaluations of cultural aspects, showcasing a complex landscape that includes both appreciation and areas for enhancement.&lt;SEP&gt;A dimension assessing cultural engagement and satisfaction among retirees.&lt;SEP&gt;A dimension assessing cultural satisfaction among students, with a score of 3.40/5.&lt;SEP&gt;Culture refers to cultural aspects, which are underrepresented in the survey responses possibly due to question formulation or participant interest.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-bc2a4c9fbcd8f37dfe48f336cbbe23d7-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c6e43bd634411734a6b905f38e6c188f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9d0d1641d86faa1a8df6dd5a1e615c1d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8aad22cd547f46981c0c7e2b64860b22-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5fedbc4a6b16f609bda38e59c975501c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-74905ab4a9718f1c4ec97ba6f336e723-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b6654ba40869e4446884d807777b08c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-602c83a7ec390ae9e25b67b17988dedc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4fc690b476bf00502fa678c4931b4fb2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-be2a5df1e51e18d87ddafb6b28a369d8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d8b4d39bd79510a410aa6623160f3ac3-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
