  <data key="d2">A profession representing individuals who are civil servants working for the government.&lt;SEP&gt;A person employed by the government or public sector, mentioned in the input text.&lt;SEP&gt;A civil servant involved in public service and quality of life dimensions.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific employment status referring to civil servants or government officials.&lt;SEP&gt;A human individual with a profession in public service, often engaged in administrative tasks and responsibilities within a governmental organization or public sector.&lt;SEP&gt;A professional designation for civil servants referenced in the verbatims who express views on quality of life.</data>
