<node id="Bastia">
  <data key="d0">Bastia</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Bastia is a city located in France on the island of Corsica, recognized for its historical significance and Mediterranean climate. This commune serves as a central hub for various activities, including a citizen survey aimed at assessing the quality of life from 2024 to 2026. The survey includes a diverse group of twenty participants, indicating community engagement in local governance and well-being.

Geographically, Bastia is marked by specific coordinates, and is often referenced in discussions relating to various geographic features. Its location is highlighted by several statistical attributes, including elevation, population demographics, and other associated metrics. Bastia not only represents a distinct urban area but also encompasses smaller municipalities within its vicinity, which contributes to its role as a geographical reference point.

As a notable location, Bastia is characterized by diverse geographic features and holds significance in statistical data related to its attributes and measurements. Through this multifaceted approach, Bastia is portrayed as both a historical city with rich cultural heritage and a modern commune actively participating in initiatives that impact local life quality.&lt;SEP&gt;Bastia is a commune earning a score of approximately 148.09 in terms of local services and living conditions.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c6e43bd634411734a6b905f38e6c188f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5fedbc4a6b16f609bda38e59c975501c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-37b4833e5a4ced914cfa6572c9de7980-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-777694a44f13262592ed81218ebc8532-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-777694a44f13262592ed81218ebc8532-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-777694a44f13262592ed81218ebc8532-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-777694a44f13262592ed81218ebc8532-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-777694a44f13262592ed81218ebc8532-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-777694a44f13262592ed81218ebc8532-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-777694a44f13262592ed81218ebc8532-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f4c8dcf63de01ef9ac177013b4fac892-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1787573958</data>
