<node id="Emploi">
  <data key="d0">Emploi</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Emploi, which translates to employment, encompasses various dimensions related to work opportunities and satisfaction within the job market. The entity is pivotal for quality of life, as it directly influences residents' perceptions of their employment conditions. 

In Ajaccio, Emploi has garnered considerable attention from residents, achieving a high satisfaction score of 3.91 out of 5, indicating a generally positive perception of job-related satisfaction. However, scores vary among different aspects of employment; for instance, other evaluations have reported scores like 3.73, representing a moderate perception of job opportunities, and 3.71, which pertains to employment conditions suggesting moderate satisfaction. 

Moreover, Emploi includes metrics that reflect job market stability, rated at 3.76, indicating a moderate level of contentment among individuals regarding their employment situations. There is also a notable peak in satisfaction, with one measure reflecting a score of 4.29 out of 5, demonstrating that some respondents perceive a stable economic environment through their employment experiences. 

Overall, Emploi serves as a significant indicator of employment perceptions and conditions, revealing a mixed landscape of satisfaction and opportunity among Ajaccio residents.&lt;SEP&gt;A dimension of quality of life concerning employment status and job satisfaction among retirees.&lt;SEP&gt;A dimension reflecting students' satisfaction with employment opportunities, rated at 3.28/5.&lt;SEP&gt;The concept of employment, which is directly associated with income and financial stability.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2cde183c2f8365b319d177367a294261-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8aad22cd547f46981c0c7e2b64860b22-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8aad22cd547f46981c0c7e2b64860b22-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5fedbc4a6b16f609bda38e59c975501c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-74905ab4a9718f1c4ec97ba6f336e723-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b6654ba40869e4446884d807777b08c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-602c83a7ec390ae9e25b67b17988dedc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-602c83a7ec390ae9e25b67b17988dedc-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4fc690b476bf00502fa678c4931b4fb2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-be2a5df1e51e18d87ddafb6b28a369d8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f456bef81ff3c55668e3111d92c18339-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1787573721</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
