<node id="Ajaccio">
  <data key="d0">Ajaccio</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Ajaccio is a commune and city located in France on the island of Corsica. It is noted for its residents' moderate to good satisfaction in terms of happiness and quality of life, although there are prevailing concerns about future prospects among the population. Ajaccio serves as the basis for a citizen inquiry survey involving a group of 39 individuals, which highlighted various environmental concerns including pollution and the importance of preserving natural spaces.

The city is characterized by a higher cost of living in comparison to rural areas of Corsica, contributing to challenges related to income and living standards faced by its residents. This economic dynamic often exacerbates criticisms regarding the financial well-being of the populace. Furthermore, Ajaccio has been presented in datasets measuring various attributes in 2020 and 2021, encompassing aspects such as housing, demographics, and crime rates.

Geographically, Ajaccio holds significance within its region, benefiting from a Mediterranean climate and being surrounded by beautiful coastal scenery. Its historical importance is also recognized, making it a notable locality not just for its modern challenges but also for its cultural and historical heritage. Overall, Ajaccio encapsulates a blend of environmental issues, economic conditions, and demographic characteristics that shape the community's identity and future outlook.&lt;SEP&gt;Ajaccio is a commune that has a score of approximately 92.96 for happiness and includes several quality of life metrics.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-8aad22cd547f46981c0c7e2b64860b22-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2172b80c51b8f07f0605ed31d163c678-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bf25f68ea81a22ee71324cef1678c9e8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f541c2807d6c4d63a01d58617023f7d7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f541c2807d6c4d63a01d58617023f7d7-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-777694a44f13262592ed81218ebc8532-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-777694a44f13262592ed81218ebc8532-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-777694a44f13262592ed81218ebc8532-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-777694a44f13262592ed81218ebc8532-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-777694a44f13262592ed81218ebc8532-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f4c8dcf63de01ef9ac177013b4fac892-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1787573958</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bonheur">
  <data key="d0">Bonheur</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Bonheur is the French word for happiness, which receives an average satisfaction score of 3.74/5 from the residents of Ajaccio.&lt;SEP&gt;Bonheur represents the concept of happiness, assessed with a score of 3.55 out of 5, indicating moderate satisfaction among respondents.&lt;SEP&gt;Bonheur represents happiness levels among the residents of Corte, rated at 3.52 out of 5, indicating a moderate level of happiness.&lt;SEP&gt;Bonheur refers to the overall happiness score, which is rated at 4.00 out of 5, indicating a generally positive perception of well-being.&lt;SEP&gt;A measure of happiness expressed by respondents in terms of their life satisfaction, rated 3.66 out of 5.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-8aad22cd547f46981c0c7e2b64860b22-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5fedbc4a6b16f609bda38e59c975501c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-74905ab4a9718f1c4ec97ba6f336e723-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b6654ba40869e4446884d807777b08c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-602c83a7ec390ae9e25b67b17988dedc-chunk-000</data>
