<node id="Qualité de vie">
  <data key="d0">Qualité de vie</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Qualité de vie translates to quality of life, which receives an average score of 3.85/5, indicating a relatively positive perception among Ajaccio residents.&lt;SEP&gt;Qualité de vie indicates the residents' overall perception of their living conditions, rated at 3.81 out of 5, reflecting a somewhat positive outlook.&lt;SEP&gt;A qualitative assessment of living conditions in Corsica, indicated by a score of 3.83 out of 5.&lt;SEP&gt;An abstract idea reflecting the overall happiness, well-being, and satisfaction of individuals in their living conditions.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-8aad22cd547f46981c0c7e2b64860b22-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-74905ab4a9718f1c4ec97ba6f336e723-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-602c83a7ec390ae9e25b67b17988dedc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4fc690b476bf00502fa678c4931b4fb2-chunk-000</data>
