<node id="Réseau">
  <data key="d0">Réseau</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Réseau means network, receiving a score of 3.49/5, reflecting resident perspectives on community connectivity and relationships.&lt;SEP&gt;Réseau refers to network services, with a score of 3.73 out of 5, indicating a moderate level of satisfaction.&lt;SEP&gt;Réseau represents social networks, rated at 3.48 out of 5, reflecting moderate satisfaction levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Réseau denotes network satisfaction, achieving a score of 3.14 out of 5, indicating a moderate perception of connectivity.&lt;SEP&gt;A concept related to social connections, scored 3.53 out of 5.&lt;SEP&gt;A dimension of quality of life related to social networks and community interactions among retirees.&lt;SEP&gt;Evaluates students' satisfaction with their social network, scoring 3.65/5.</data>
