  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Ratio vie pro/vie perso means work-life balance, scoring 3.19/5, indicating a moderate satisfaction concerning this aspect of life.&lt;SEP&gt;Ratio vie pro/vie perso denotes the work-life balance, rated at 3.44 out of 5.&lt;SEP&gt;A score (3.35 out of 5) reflecting the balance between professional and personal life.&lt;SEP&gt;A dimension evaluating the balance between professional life and personal life satisfaction of retirees.</data>
