<node id="Institutions">
  <data key="d0">Institutions</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Institutions refer to local governing bodies and public organizations responsible for managing various public services and support systems within a community. They have been assessed across several dimensions, revealing overall dissatisfaction and distrust among the public. 

The average satisfaction score for institutions was recorded as 2.93 out of 5, indicating a perception of dysfunction in public services. Specifically, assessments reflected a slightly lower score of 2.86, further highlighting growing dissatisfaction with these local institutions. This leads to a concerning performance rating of just 2.29 out of 5, which emphasizes a significant level of distrust towards these governing bodies. 

Additionally, the measure of satisfaction with institutional support services available, particularly for retirees, provides another aspect of public service evaluation, although specific details on this score were not provided. Overall, the compiled data suggests a critical view towards local institutions, marked by low satisfaction and an urgent need for improvement in public service governance.&lt;SEP&gt;Evaluates students' satisfaction with institutions, scoring 2.84/5.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-8aad22cd547f46981c0c7e2b64860b22-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8aad22cd547f46981c0c7e2b64860b22-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5fedbc4a6b16f609bda38e59c975501c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-74905ab4a9718f1c4ec97ba6f336e723-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b6654ba40869e4446884d807777b08c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b6654ba40869e4446884d807777b08c-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-602c83a7ec390ae9e25b67b17988dedc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4fc690b476bf00502fa678c4931b4fb2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-be2a5df1e51e18d87ddafb6b28a369d8-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1787573422</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Tourisme">
  <data key="d0">Tourisme</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Tourisme refers to the tourism sector and encompasses various dimensions of the travel and leisure industry. The overall evaluations of Tourisme yield low satisfaction scores, with ratings predominantly around 2.63 to 2.83 out of 5. These scores indicate a significant level of dissatisfaction regarding local tourist attractions and experiences as perceived by residents and visitors alike.

Specifically, one notable aspect of Tourisme is its representation of tourism satisfaction. The ratings, such as 2.71 out of 5, reflect prevailing concerns regarding the tourism sector in locations like Porto-Vecchio. This suggests that there are challenges in how the tourism industry is perceived, pointing to various factors that contribute to general disappointment among stakeholders.

Additionally, the scores related to Tourisme highlight an ongoing evaluation of tourism experiences, particularly among retirees, further emphasizing the need for improvement within the sector. On average, the scores suggest that there is a consistent theme of dissatisfaction that underlines the current state of tourism in the area, reflecting a call for enhancements to better meet the expectations and experiences of tourists.&lt;SEP&gt;A dimension measuring students' satisfaction with tourism, receiving a score of 3.02/5.&lt;SEP&gt;Tourisme is seen as an economic opportunity but also poses constraints on individuals who feel compelled to work.&lt;SEP&gt;Tourisme refers to the economic activity related to travel and visitation, perceived both as an opportunity for economic growth and a potential constraint for local resources.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-8aad22cd547f46981c0c7e2b64860b22-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8aad22cd547f46981c0c7e2b64860b22-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5fedbc4a6b16f609bda38e59c975501c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-74905ab4a9718f1c4ec97ba6f336e723-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b6654ba40869e4446884d807777b08c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b6654ba40869e4446884d807777b08c-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-602c83a7ec390ae9e25b67b17988dedc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4fc690b476bf00502fa678c4931b4fb2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-be2a5df1e51e18d87ddafb6b28a369d8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d8b4d39bd79510a410aa6623160f3ac3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d8b4d39bd79510a410aa6623160f3ac3-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1787573537</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
