  <data key="d2">AttenteRDV refers to waiting for medical appointments, receiving a score of 2.53/5, indicating dissatisfaction among residents regarding the waiting times for healthcare services.&lt;SEP&gt;AttenteRDV involves waiting times for appointments, evaluated at 2.09 out of 5, indicating dissatisfaction in how long it takes to get medical appointments.&lt;SEP&gt;A concept indicating the rating and satisfaction level related to appointment waiting times, represented by a score of 2.51 out of 5.</data>
