  <data key="d2">Encombrement denotes congestion, evaluated at 2.00 out of 5, reflecting dissatisfaction with traffic and congestion levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Encombrement is a metric scoring 2.64 out of 5, suggesting the level of congestion within the transportation network and its impact on overall accessibility.&lt;SEP&gt;A metric indicating satisfaction related to congestion or overcrowding, rated similarly on a star scale with a detailed breakdown of ratings.&lt;SEP&gt;Encombrement is rated 2.23/5, highlighting problems with congestion in the transport system.&lt;SEP&gt;Measures satisfaction regarding congestion, with a score of 2.65/5.</data>
