  <data key="d0">Services Publics</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A concept associated with public institutions, which have received low ratings, relating to perceptions of trust and reliability in public services.&lt;SEP&gt;Government-provided services that are essential for community welfare, which may be underdeveloped in the current analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;Public services are another theme that is infrequently addressed in the survey, suggesting a similar pattern of disinterest.</data>
