  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A concept relating to the balance between work life and personal life, which has received a moderate average score but displays significant disparities in individual evaluations.&lt;SEP&gt;Équilibre Vie Professionnelle/Vie Personnelle refers to the balance between personal and professional life that residents aim to achieve to prevent stress or burnout.&lt;SEP&gt;Highlights the significance of personal time and flexibility between professional and personal life.</data>
