<node id="Corte">
  <data key="d0">Corte</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Corte is a commune where residents participate in a citizen survey regarding quality of life, yielding various ratings across several dimensions of satisfaction.&lt;SEP&gt;Corte is a location in Corsica, represented by a survey group of 41 individuals participating in the citizen investigation regarding quality of life in Corsica from 2024 to 2026.&lt;SEP&gt;A town in Corsica with emphasis on the natural environment surrounding it as vital for residents' quality of life.&lt;SEP&gt;A town in Corsica that is used as a case study in the citizen inquiry regarding income and quality of life.&lt;SEP&gt;Corte is a central location associated with various geographic coordinates and related metrics, including several specific neighborhoods and landmarks within it.&lt;SEP&gt;Corte is a geographic location associated with various coordinates and data points listed in the provided information.&lt;SEP&gt;Corte is a geographic location characterized by various numerical metrics related to its attributes.</data>
