  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Seniors refers to individuals aged 60 and above, who are underrepresented in the survey, with only 3-4 responses from individuals over 50 years old.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d8b4d39bd79510a410aa6623160f3ac3-chunk-001</data>
