</node>
<node id="Grosseto-Prugna">
  <data key="d0">Grosseto-Prugna</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Grosseto-Prugna is a locality that is the subject of a citizen survey regarding quality of life, with a particular focus on various social themes and resident feedback on their living conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Grosseto-Prugna is a commune adjacent to Ajaccio, recognized for its blend of natural and residential areas.&lt;SEP&gt;Grosseto-Prugna is a location with various numerical metrics associated with its features.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fc76b7f4d4c75d4ea66d01fc9075ce68-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-777694a44f13262592ed81218ebc8532-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f4c8dcf63de01ef9ac177013b4fac892-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1787573958</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Revenus et Pouvoir dAchat">
  <data key="d0">Revenus et Pouvoir dAchat</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Revenus et Pouvoir d’Achat highlights the importance of income and purchasing power for residents’ quality of life and mental well-being in Grosseto-Prugna.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fc76b7f4d4c75d4ea66d01fc9075ce68-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1787573569</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
