<node id="Diversity Culturelle">
  <data key="d0">Diversity Culturelle</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Diversity Culturelle denotes cultural diversity aspects mentioned by respondents, highlighting their awareness or appreciation of linguistic and cultural plurality in their environment.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fc76b7f4d4c75d4ea66d01fc9075ce68-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1787573569</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Verbatim 1">
  <data key="d0">Verbatim 1</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Verbatim 1 consists of feedback from respondents regarding the quality of life in Grosseto-Prugna, specifically mentioning safety and security concerns.&lt;SEP&gt;Verbatim 1 represents a direct quote from a respondent emphasizing the necessity of income for securing housing and basic needs.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fc76b7f4d4c75d4ea66d01fc9075ce68-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f541c2807d6c4d63a01d58617023f7d7-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1787573686</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Verbatim 2">
  <data key="d0">Verbatim 2</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Verbatim 2 captures another aspect of respondent feedback, reflecting ambiguity in how safety is perceived, including cultural themes such as language and religion.&lt;SEP&gt;Verbatim 2 is a direct quote from a respondent underscoring that without income, they cannot afford basic life necessities.&lt;SEP&gt;A statement from the survey respondents emphasizing that health is prioritized over income, highlighting a perspective on the relationship between wealth and well-being.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fc76b7f4d4c75d4ea66d01fc9075ce68-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f541c2807d6c4d63a01d58617023f7d7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f456bef81ff3c55668e3111d92c18339-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1787573721</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Verbatim 3">
  <data key="d0">Verbatim 3</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Verbatim 3 includes explicit references to security within the context of the survey feedback, indicating a direct concern about safety for residents in Grosseto-Prugna.&lt;SEP&gt;Verbatim 3 is a direct quote expressing frustration about the high cost of living without corresponding income.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fc76b7f4d4c75d4ea66d01fc9075ce68-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f541c2807d6c4d63a01d58617023f7d7-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1787573686</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Revenus et Qualité de Vie">
  <data key="d0">Revenus et Qualité de Vie</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Refers to the importance of income and quality of life, emphasizing that without income, a decent life is unattainable.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-705b4ab560e98a9130a4a5665f8b6ede-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1787573599</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
